     1,
     "<div><div style=\"width:576px\"><p>Hi all!  D-RUG has wrapped up for the fall quarter and it&#39;s time to figure out our winter meeting times and topics.</p>\r\nIf you have trouble viewing or submitting this form, you can fill it out online:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1ZdMiT-7JGY7MTwenGvfsVfP-zTChSJubyUhggvEwVfc/viewform\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1ZdMiT-7JGY7MTwenGvfsVfP-zTChSJubyUhggvEwVfc/viewform&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469207241000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Lek0oFigWNMUTlKf5igtW\">https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1ZdMiT-7JGY7MTwenGvfsVfP-zTChSJubyUhggvEwVfc/viewform</a>\r\n<p></p>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><h1 dir=\"ltr\">Help Us Pick a Meeting Time!</h1></div>\r\n<div style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;display:inline\"><div style=\"font:inherit;width:99%;margin:0 0 1em;white-space:pre-wrap;word-wrap:break-word\">We&#39;re picking a time for the winter quarter.  Fill out this form to pick out a time and help us plan.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div><div><form action=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/1ZdMiT-7JGY7MTwenGvfsVfP-zTChSJubyUhggvEwVfc/formResponse\" method=\"POST\" target=\"_blank\"><ol style=\"padding-left:0\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label aria-hidden><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">What times can you meet?\r\n<label aria-label=\"(Required field)\"></label>\r\n<span style=\"color:#c43b1d\">*</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\">Please check all times that work for you</div></label>\r\n\r\n<ul role=\"group\" aria-label=\"What times can you meet? Please check all times that work for you Please select at least one!\" style=\"list-style:none;margin:.5em 0 0 0;padding:0\"><li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Mon 1-3\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\n<span>Mon 1-3</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Mon 3-5\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\n<span>Mon 3-5</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Tues 10-12\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\n<span>Tues 10-12</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Tues 1-3\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\n<span>Tues 1-3</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Tues 3-5\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\n<span>Tues 3-5</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Wed 10-12\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\n<span>Wed 10-12</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Wed 1-3\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\n<span>Wed 1-3</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Wed 3-5\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\n<span>Wed 3-5</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Thu 10-12\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\n<span>Thu 10-12</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Thu 1-3\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\n<span>Thu 1-3</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"Fri 10-12\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\n<span>Fri 10-12</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"entry.2079587304\" value=\"__other_option__\" role=\"checkbox\"></span>\r\nOther:</label>\r\n<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"text\" name=\"entry.2079587304.other_option_response\" value=\"\" dir=\"auto\" aria-label=\"Other\"></span>\r\n</li></ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label aria-hidden><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">Would you like to present at a D-RUG meeting this winter?\r\n<label aria-label=\"(Required field)\"></label>\r\n<span style=\"color:#c43b1d\">*</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n\r\n<ul role=\"radiogroup\" aria-label=\"Would you like to present at a D-RUG meeting this winter?  \" style=\"list-style:none;margin:.5em 0 0 0;padding:0\"><li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.672893051\" value=\"Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;How-to&quot; on some topic or tool.\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;How-to&quot; on some topic or tool.\"></span>\r\n<span>Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;How-to&quot; on some topic or tool.</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.672893051\" value=\"Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;Show-and-tell&quot; of something I&#39;m working on and get feedback.\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;Show-and-tell&quot; of something I&#39;m working on and get feedback.\"></span>\r\n<span>Yup! I&#39;d like to do a &quot;Show-and-tell&quot; of something I&#39;m working on and get feedback.</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.672893051\" value=\"Both!\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"Both!\"></span>\r\n<span>Both!</span>\r\n</label></li> <li style=\"margin:0;line-height:1.3em;padding-bottom:.5em\"><label><span style=\"display:inline-block\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"entry.672893051\" value=\"Probably not.\" role=\"radio\" aria-label=\"Probably not.\"></span>\r\n<span>Probably not.</span>\r\n</label></li></ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label aria-hidden><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">If you selected &quot;Yup!&quot;, any idea what the topic would be?\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\">This isn&#39;t written in stone or anything. I just want to get an idea of how many people are interested in presenting and what the potential topics might be.</div></label>\r\n<textarea name=\"entry.1158270743\" rows=\"8\" cols=\"0\" dir=\"auto\" aria-label=\"If you selected &quot;Yup!&quot;, any idea what the topic would be? This isn&#39;t written in stone or anything. I just want to get an idea of how many people are interested in presenting and what the potential topics might be. \" style=\"width:70%\"></textarea>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label aria-hidden><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">Are there any topics or activities you&#39;d like to see covered by others at D-RUG this winter?\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n<textarea name=\"entry.305988350\" rows=\"8\" cols=\"0\" dir=\"auto\" aria-label=\"Are there any topics or activities you&#39;d like to see covered by others at D-RUG this winter?  \" style=\"width:70%\"></textarea>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div> <div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin:12px 0\"><div style=\"max-width:100%\"><label aria-hidden><div style=\"display:block;font-weight:bold\">Your E-mail \r\n<label aria-label=\"(Required field)\"></label>\r\n<span style=\"color:#c43b1d\">*</span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"display:block;margin:.1em 0 .25em 0;color:#666\"></div></label>\r\n<input type=\"text\" name=\"entry.1862046737\" value=\"\" dir=\"auto\" aria-label=\"Your E-mail   \" aria-required title=\"\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div></div></div>\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"draftResponse\" value=\"[]\r\n\">\r\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"pageHistory\" value=\"0\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin:12px 0\"><table><tbody><tr><td dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:100%;display:inline-block\">\r\n<input type=\"submit\" name=\"submit\" value=\"Submit\">\r\n<div style=\"color:#666\">Never submit passwords through Google Forms.</div></td>\r\n</tr></tbody></table></div></ol></form></div>\r\n<div><div></div>\r\n<div><div></div>\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"margin-top:2em\"><span>Powered by</span>\r\n<a href=\"http://drive.google.com\" style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:middle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://drive.google.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469207241000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0D9NdYQHobI_RctQ50vJw5\"><img src=\"https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/vsylq52JJYrBNN2ojhdRFkUxISPrD60Pq_I3a1AXBOy02k7_63y