     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"gmail_extra\">Hi all,</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">So far we&#39;ve had 16 responses to the survey to pick a Winter D-RUG meeting time.  Currently Monday 3-5 is winning, but there&#39;s lots of variation, so vote for preferred times so you can make it next quarter!  Click here to fill out the survey: <a href=\"http://goo.gl/XoHQKm\" style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://goo.gl/XoHQKm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792469207242000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1l1SP2RYMXZqpBAWHCpfcD\">http://goo.gl/XoHQKm</a></div>\r\n<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br></div><div class=\"gmail_extra\">The results so far:</div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/davis-rug/attach/7f576161cba14def/Screenshot%202013-12-11%2014.31.08.png?part=0.1\" alt=\"Inline image 1\"><br></div></div>\r\n"
